on": "html_entity_unescape+unicode_quote_dash_fold+whitespace_collapse+casefold", "text_encoding": "utf-8", "title": "49 CFR Part 395 Subpart A General Hours-of-Service Rules", "url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-05-12/title-49.xml?part=395&subpart=A", "verified_as_of": "2026-07-29", "zh_interpretation": "现行官方运输或机组规则按主体与运行类型规定驾驶或执勤窗口、休息安排、累计限制及例外；试点招募或错误运行类型不能替代普遍适用规则。"}
{"content_type": "text/xml", "effective_from": "2026-04-22", "effective_from_basis": "exact eCFR point-in-time edition requested for the decision date", "effective_interval_kind": "exact_point_in_time_edition", "effective_to": "2026-04-22", "fetch_metadata_sha256": "3c518412f131056f16034b4bd03756277c76b16e72af660e2f54ea1caf28ca66", "fetched_at": "2026-07-29T19:13:06+00:00", "fetched_at_kind": "actual_http_get_timestamp", "final_url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-04-22/title-21.xml?part=101&section=101.91", "issuer": "Electronic Code of Federal Regulations", "operative_verification_instruction": "提取与“麸质含量阈值与gluten-free声明如何约束同一包装食品的配方和标签组合”直接相关的现行定义、资格、约束或目标项结构；蓝图不预写数值。", "point_in_time_decision": "2026-04-22", "raw_content_sha256": "886de24e958286e29b90a2f1fc68357b73618e76849b2895de2b965636cb086f", "raw_path": "private/web_snapshots/raw/d943047e65b3f0ca8cb92a0a62a3ac79311ac7bcd3c61e97b96020d004826d21.response", "raw_size_bytes": 5913, "response_headers": {"content-type": "text/xml", "date": "Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:13:06 GMT"}, "snapshot_id": "SNAP-9CEE13A8683AC20D", "snapshot_sha256": "886de24e958286e29b90a2f1fc68357b73618e76849b2895de2b965636cb086f", "snapshot_sha256_kind": "exact_http_response_bytes", "snapshot_status": "frozen_raw_official_http_response_with_verified_support_fragment", "source_version": "ecfr-point-in-time-2026-04-22", "source_version_date": "2026-04-22", "source_version_date_kind": "ecfr_point_in_time_edition_date", "status_code": 200, "support_excerpt": "The labeling claim \"gluten-free\" means: (i) That the food bearing the claim in its labeling: (A) Does not contain any one of the following: ( 1 ) An ingredient that is a gluten-containing grain (e.g., spelt wheat); ( 2 ) An ingredient that is derived from a gluten-containing grain and that has not been processed to remove gluten (e.g., wheat flour); or ( 3 ) An ingredient that is derived from a gluten-containing grain and that has been processed to remove gluten (e.g., wheat starch), if the use of that ingredient results in the presence of 20 parts per million (ppm) or more gluten in the food", "support_excerpt_kind": "frozen_operative_fragment", "support_excerpt_verified_in_normalized_dom_text": true, "support_excerpts": ["The labeling claim \"gluten-free\" means: (i) That the food bearing the claim in its labeling: (A) Does not contain any one of the following: ( 1 ) An ingredient that is a gluten-containing grain (e.g., spelt wheat); ( 2 ) An ingredient that is derived from a gluten-containing grain and that has not been processed to remove gluten (e.g., wheat flour); or ( 3 ) An ingredient that is derived from a gluten-containing grain and that has been processed to remove gluten (e.g., wheat starch), if the use of that ingredient results in the presence of 20 parts per million (ppm) or more gluten in the food", "A food that bears the claim \"gluten-free\" in its labeling and fails to meet the requirements of paragraph (a)(3) of this section and, if applicable, paragraphs (c)(2) through (4) of this section will be deemed misbranded"], "support_text_normalization": "html_entity_unescape+unicode_quote_dash_fold+whitespace_collapse+casefold", "text_encoding": "UTF-8", "title": "21 CFR 101.91 Gluten-Free Labeling of Food", "url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-04-22/title-21.xml?part=101&section=101.91", "verified_as_of": "2026-07-29", "zh_interpretation": "现行食品营养或标签规则按产品、经营主体、份量或供餐对象规定必须提供的组成、声明或服务项，并存在产品类别和主体例外。"}
