{"content_type": "application/xml; charset=utf-8", "effective_from": "2026-06-10", "effective_from_basis": "exact eCFR point-in-time edition requested for the decision date", "effective_interval_kind": "exact_point_in_time_edition", "effective_to": "2026-06-10", "fetch_metadata_sha256": "8e31eff01f4fbad0e0b3a8230ac8dda31705549b77fcf21453e78ccb908249ae", "fetched_at": "2026-07-29T19:13:22+00:00", "fetched_at_kind": "actual_http_get_timestamp", "final_url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-06-10/title-40.xml?part=63&subpart=EEE", "issuer": "Electronic Code of Federal Regulations", "operative_verification_instruction": "提取与“排放规则和运行状态如何要求医疗废物服务组合配置污染控制能力”直接相关的现行定义、资格、约束或目标项结构；蓝图不预写数值。", "point_in_time_decision": "2026-06-10", "raw_content_sha256": "010c9e34757daaea364401e08c3b62a900724c79e417378be76466274acda2c5", "raw_path": "private/web_snapshots/raw/1866b2d3c07024c2e686e36a443cf3028657d36f1a98f883e1f846ecda7ea65a.response", "raw_size_bytes": 460599, "response_headers": {"content-type": "application/xml; charset=utf-8", "date": "Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:13:22 GMT"}, "snapshot_id": "SNAP-F66EDD0C8BB7DB0B", "snapshot_sha256": "010c9e34757daaea364401e08c3b62a900724c79e417378be76466274acda2c5", "snapshot_sha256_kind": "exact_http_response_bytes", "snapshot_status": "frozen_raw_official_http_response_with_verified_support_fragment", "source_version": "ecfr-point-in-time-2026-06-10", "source_version_date": "2026-06-10", "source_version_date_kind": "ecfr_point_in_time_edition_date", "status_code": 200, "support_excerpt": "The provisions of this subpart apply to all hazardous waste combustors: hazardous waste incinerators, hazardous waste cement kilns, hazardous waste lightweight aggregate kilns, hazardous waste solid fuel boilers, hazardous waste liquid fuel boilers, and hazardous waste hydrochloric acid production furnaces", "support_excerpt_kind": "frozen_operative_fragment", "support_excerpt_verified_in_normalized_dom_text": true, "support_excerpts": ["The provisions of this subpart apply to all hazardous waste combustors: hazardous waste incinerators, hazardous waste cement kilns, hazardous waste lightweight aggregate kilns, hazardous waste solid fuel boilers, hazardous waste liquid fuel boilers, and hazardous waste hydrochloric acid production furnaces", "Emission limits for existing sources. You must not discharge or cause combustion gases to be emitted into the atmosphere that contain:", "Mercury in excess of 130 µg/dscm, corrected to 7 percent oxygen"], "support_text_normalization": "html_entity_unescape+unicode_quote_dash_fold+whitespace_collapse+casefold", "text_encoding": "utf-8", "title": "40 CFR Part 63 Subpart EEE National Emission Standards for Hazardous Waste Combustors", "url": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-06-10/title-40.xml?part=63&subpart=EEE", "verified_as_of": "2026-07-29", "zh_interpretation": "现行排放与危险废物规则先按设施、废物和活动分类，再激活相应处理、储存、时间、记录或排放控制要求；州级加严和规则版本需要单独核验。"}
